anine equity in the total amount of $14,104 was converted into 10,526,300 Class A ordinary shares as permanent equity.","context":"Holders of Class A ordinary shares and Class B ordinary shares have the same rights except for voting, transfer and conversion rights. Each Class A ordinary share is entitled to one vote, and each Class B ordinary share is entitled to ten votes. Each Class B ordinary share is convertible into one Class A ordinary share at any time by the holder thereof, while Class A ordinary shares are not convertible into Class B ordinary shares under any circumstances.","section":"The Group does not discuss recent pronouncements that are not anticipated to have an impact on or are unrelated to its consolidated financial condition, results of operations, cash flows or disclosures.","block":2039,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-037444","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-03-31","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001868395","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1868395/000121390026037444/ea0283593-20f_planet.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/08700702f51908fdf7b468b6db7b00fcc995809e478ed1a74868d2e38614fe97.bin","sha256":"08700702f51908fdf7b468b6db7b00fcc995809e478ed1a74868d2e38614fe97"}},{"id":"f00e52e3b61a3b20dd9fa1153d5af4e01215aa9c9b60a6db28d9eb5cccb74aa6","quote":"As of December 31, 2024 and 2025, the number of the Company’s authorized Class A ordinary shares was 2,000,000,000, and the number of the Company’s issued Class A ordinary shares was 27,565,800 and 32,918,421, respectively. As of December 31, 2024 and 2025, the number of the Company’s authorized Class B ordinary shares was 1,000,000,000, and issued Class B ordinary shares was 26,315,800.","context":"On January 29, 2024, the Company closed its initial public offering on the Nasdaq Capital Market where 1,250,000 Class A ordinary shares were newly issued at a price of $4.0 per share with the 